# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Thuthi Dairy Web -- environment configuration
# Copy to `.env` for local overrides, or set these in your Vercel project's
# Environment Variables screen for a deployment. Vite only exposes variables
# prefixed with VITE_ to client-side code.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Base URL of the deployed API, including the /api/v1 prefix.
# Leave unset in local development -- vite.config.ts proxies /api to
# http://localhost:5000 automatically, which is what makes the httpOnly
# refresh cookie work without cross-site cookie settings.
#
# In production this MUST point at your deployed backend, e.g.:
# VITE_API_URL=https://thuthi-dairy-api.onrender.com/api/v1
VITE_API_URL=
